lness veterinary care to our colleagues.\nNeurology\nInternal Medicine\nCritical Care\nNeurology\nInternal Medicine\nCritical Care\nNeurology\nInternal Medicine\nCritical Care\nNeurology\nSurgery\nOncology\nOphthalmology\nSurgery\nOncology\nOphthalmology\nSurgery\nOncology\nOphthalmology\nSurgery\nGive Us A Call\nPhone:\n(317) 782-4484\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWed\nOpen 24 hrs\nThu\nOpen 24 hrs\nFri\nOpen 24 hrs\nSat\nOpen 24 hrs\nSun\nOpen 24 hrs\nClient Testimonials & Reviews\nDon't just take our word for it! We at IndyVet have been dedicated to providing our care to the Indianapolis community since 1994, and we strive to treat your pets with the same care and compassion as if they were our own.\nIndyVet Affiliations\nCat Friendly Practice\nAAHA\nAVMF\nCare Credit\nFear Free\nCat Friendly Practice\nAAHA\nAVMF\nCare Credit\nFear Free\nCat Friendly Practice\nAAHA\nAVMF\nCare Credit\nFear Free\nCat Friendly Practice\nTerms & Conditions\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility\nCareers\nCookie Preferences\nDo Not Sell or Share My Information\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
